    "slug": "species",
    "title": "Especies",
    "content": "# Especies\n\n  Nanotrasen emplea a muchas especies inteligentes.\n\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobArachnid\" Caption=\"Arácnido\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobDiona\" Caption=\"Diona\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobDwarf\" Caption=\"Enano\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobHuman\" Caption=\"Humano\"/>\n  </Box>\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobMoth\" Caption=\"Persona polilla\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobReptilian\" Caption=\"Reptiliano\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobSlimePerson\" Caption=\"Persona slime\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobVox\" Caption=\"Vox\"/>\n  </Box>\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobVulpkanin\" Caption=\"Vulpkanin\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobFelinid\" Caption=\"Felínido\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobSwine\" Caption=\"Trottin\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobTajaran\" Caption=\"Tajara\"/>\n  </Box>\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobPredator\" Caption=\"Yautja\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobXenoDummy\" Caption=\"Xenomorfo\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobDemon\" Caption=\"Arcana\"/>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobResomi\" Caption=\"Resomi\"/>\n  </Box>\n  <Box>\n    <GuideEntityEmbed Entity=\"MobMilira\" Caption=\"Milira\"/>\n  </Box>",
